{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191", "ja": "プロローグ", "zh": "序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "29282573c09ce6bfd08f9ecf4a781e364f5a2af8de3c27b058e8236952da68cb", "ja": "あ！　やっと見つけました！\n{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "啊！终于找到你了！\n{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a59e40c820d8e2a5d6d468ccc1f2e3161098cd55e86c487210ac64e8d43e5839", "ja": "青羽さん！　お疲れさまです。いやぁ、\n今日はずいぶんと暑いですね……。", "zh": "青羽小姐！工作辛苦了。\n唉～今天可真热呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "f504a1fcc51339e0ae4f3cb3e97afdd21edf2bf0efae2429189086c58c911f07", "ja": "ですよね～。でもきっと梅雨が明けるまでは、\nずっとこんな感じになりそうです……はうう。", "zh": "就是说啊～但梅雨季结束之前，\n大概都会是这种感觉吧……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "332cd512e92e679472d0557bff46a06a0ee503fb82f9bf074f1facbaa7377df9", "ja": "アイドルも何人かバテぎみで、心配です……\nというか青羽さん、俺に何か用事でも？", "zh": "有几位偶像都有点热坏了，真让人担心……\n话说青羽小姐，你找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "0c81326d23c7f1d2daf7b1e7cd01ab803f1a63cbf8e67462cd5018ef54cd59af", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！　社長さんがお呼びなんです。\n時間のあるときに、事務所に行ってあげてくださいね。", "zh": "啊，我都忘了！社长在找你。\n麻烦你有空的时候，跑一趟事务所啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fd5b2d87361057750f27cd50b74e1fca9c04fb7e54cd68e65c8a26bfb78d05d5", "ja": "そうでしたか。分かりました。\nさっそく行ってみますね！", "zh": "原来是这样啊，我知道了。\n那我立刻过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "369017d0ae27b45fef69f9ff430dee3ec3d949b67e6e568d976d53915eba9c92", "ja": "はい♪　いってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好的♪请慢走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3a715abb11095e290573a4874b6015105cc2e12c004ef892c16ef664b0088ccf", "ja": "失礼します！\n社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "打扰了！\n社长、音无小姐，两位辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "86f64029e6ddc539e12747e90298ae7a6a9fe921dde5c0b503fba289ad8bb01f", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你也辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "78ac151b479b4d82bdb79094a681d577cd796fc512ab5f5695227f65f0bbb1b8", "ja": "いやあ、君！\nこの暑い中ご苦労だったね。", "zh": "哎呀，你来啦！\n天气这么热，真是辛苦啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "bfe544e6a37460ddccb0cf15a45f2a7c05c8adc5d8fe875ffba5501fa7eb5fb5", "ja": "そうだ。\n冷たい麦茶がありますから、持ってきますね♪", "zh": "对了，\n有冰麦茶可以喝，我去拿来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "825b5210a74a48ca56c2c07375373717da3a3ced1911d44d139a82652f3c7b0a", "ja": "それは嬉しいな。\n外が蒸し暑かったので助かります。", "zh": "那太好了。\n来的路上外头很闷热，我很需要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "da94a01f8a8127bde55c1f9e7dafb96eb9fcb5104a4b97c0e3804affe420de2c", "ja": "はい、どうぞ！", "zh": "来，请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d06acd4abd7c1bccc378902f636730bfc2537598232fe489891a455f145b9e47", "ja": "いただきます！\n（ゴクゴクゴク……）ああ、おいしい！", "zh": "那我不客气了！\n（咕噜咕噜咕噜……）呼，好好喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "c167ff1fb86fdd4cdc84e6b05cc8d1c9c534ef79fab5f1911f221e5e466df2e7", "ja": "はっはっはっ、いい飲みっぷりだ！　いかにも夏到来、\nという感じだね！　というわけで、早速だが……", "zh": "哈哈哈，你喝得真爽快啊！有种夏天来了的感觉！\n那么，事不宜迟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "d3d6b9dc337c26f7285b5b40f76ac185e5f91f88ce279e0e3f64fdbbc15f3088", "ja": "今日君に来てもらったのは、\n折り入って相談したいことができたからなのだよ。", "zh": "我今天找你来，\n是想跟你讨论一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "697f37a803f62e190f35e36db971e6dcbb54ade65b3fb3268778c1c863242130", "ja": "相談……というと？", "zh": "讨论……社长是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "eeae06cf3bbb945950933d0382173e606f9e49b879503657ba46ae04cab703ad", "ja": "うむ。まずはこの曲を聴いてくれたまえ。", "zh": "总之，你先听听看这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "19699928216f2f8f7e861ac9d5ebd6f30a7b181fd09ab1d2b74ce480ad9db5fb", "ja": "これは……！", "zh": "这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1a43580c2d8fb734dfaf204c6f762043401c2cd29feed14751dfbf60461cc040", "ja": "ノリも良いし、これからの季節にピッタリの曲ですね！\nもしかして、うちのアイドル達に？", "zh": "这首歌很带劲，非常适合接下来的季节呢！\n莫非这首歌是要给我们的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "3f7424bcfdf715fe2c3942c3952386fef638dbea797a4dff22821d280cedeb13", "ja": "その通り！　私の知り合いの音楽家がね、\nいい曲が出来たといって、持って来てくれたのだが……", "zh": "正是如此！这是出自我认识的音乐人之手，\n他说完成了一首好歌，就拿来给我听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "ca63eec169397edf49c05c6439b19e31418f4c143daec00dc8a978ebbf666d7f", "ja": "私も聞いた瞬間に、ピーンと来た！　\n劇場の子たちにピッタリじゃないか、とね！", "zh": "我也是在听到歌的瞬间灵机一动！\n想说应该很适合剧场的偶像们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cb56fa6036c80a3941a654287fc3ca82d3811bafb2d824f37afd521bd959a397", "ja": "ええ、俺も同感です。\nただ問題は、誰に歌わせるかですが……。", "zh": "是的，我也有同感。\n不过问题是要由谁来唱呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "20303c3a22419cdc98fecec5389e002b17a0b4bb17422ea25e4a7b7485899d14", "ja": "そのことだが、今回はメンバーの選定から全て、\n君の裁量に任せようと思う。", "zh": "关于这点，这次我打算连选择成员在内，\n所有事务都全权交由你来决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "45b23c3bddade0a4a415611e40cc5912365bd935b763f20591e91408bf92a442", "ja": "君は幾多の公演を成功させてきた男だ。\n君ならばできると、私は信じているよ！", "zh": "你可是成功举办了无数公演的男人。\n我相信你一定办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_1026", "source_sha256": "c4436c39bcdf6222bbca2845d822e3f2fde1128182f02f6e4c4c9f2571bd23e5", "ja": "社長……！", "zh": "社长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "fda2c1958ff3f8f32663576ba8631ad303c30181a04d00c8969f605671246c01", "ja": "社長……そこまで信頼してもらえるなんて……！\nわかりました。必ずやり遂げてみせます！", "zh": "社长……竟然对我如此信赖有加……！\n我知道了，我一定不会辜负使命！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "f7c5566524705c6f6ba496a34e462e0420a6dd252090a8a50f934e3872d3e29d", "ja": "うむ！　今回も存分に頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯！这次也要好好努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "f40d886bdf8c948aff604b9882e7208bf8d1339b053eaaea72dc99f6072dbecb", "ja": "はい！　任せてください！", "zh": "是！请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "16f0bda1dfcb4ffa24a5145563a211efcb9c741a7b5bf21e066a610b2373f53d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。これからかなり忙しく\nなりそうですけど、お身体には気をつけてくださいね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！你接下来应该会很忙，\n但也要注意身体健康喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "96b07c46eea1f57a07115532bdff5ec090b35e306a28cee1d3eb32cee747ce7d", "ja": "もし営業の途中でお疲れになったら、\nまた事務所に冷たい麦茶でも飲みに来てください♪", "zh": "要是跑业务的期间累了，\n再来事务所喝杯冰麦茶吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_2005", "source_sha256": "720277012ff067dfc54671c4fdcc8781c3a131fdea09d03f6dc3b7188d395c66", "ja": "音無さん……！", "zh": "音无小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3000_p", "source_sha256": "b58d89c539247fb0b7803b3e6f8826bf75b7942220d05d7e139796c9c82edaf0", "ja": "音無さん……ありがとうございます。では、その時が\n来たら遠慮なく麦茶をごちそうにあがりますね！", "zh": "音无小姐……太感谢你了。\n那么到时候我就不客气，再过来喝麦茶啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3001_101kot", "source_sha256": "89b65d5d1f454bdd8ed46a9ab788e28ad8301e93d8dd287e7add32b82e1cfdf0", "ja": "はい、いつでも大歓迎ですから。\n待ってますねっ♪", "zh": "好的，随时都很欢迎你来。\n我会在这里等你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3002_101kot", "source_sha256": "d67c5b025d941bd15c521f7f17242695b0a68f161bb2e6a8132dc6542acfa3dd", "ja": "あ、それから！　美咲ちゃんに聞いたんですけど、\nもうすぐ劇場の近くで、お祭りがあるそうですよ！", "zh": "啊，对了！我听美咲说，\n最近剧场附近好像要办祭典喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3003_p", "source_sha256": "e98efaef825cf9c8aa76ffd154618c51f01bdf2d592aad66031768a4fca31864", "ja": "へえ、それは面白そうですね。\nアイドル達も行きたがるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是吗，听起来很有趣呢。\n偶像们应该也会想去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3004_president", "source_sha256": "df28c7e32ac68d9effe2bcfb27142122284f67aceb83059f92c1835b143ddfab", "ja": "うむ！　皆で明るく楽しく元気よく、\nウェルカムサマーといこうじゃないか！　はっはっは！", "zh": "嗯！大家一起带着开朗欢乐与活力，\n去Welcome Summer吧！哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_intro_3005_p", "source_sha256": "0e638ce033916be1884085b098a94b391b44b7389bed4134eb913d65344c409a", "ja": "（そうだな。梅雨を吹き飛ばすような企画で、\n熱い夏を迎えるとしよう！）", "zh": "（说得也是。就用能够吹散梅雨的企划，\n来迎接炙热的夏天吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
